    {
      "id": "claim_d4969f6cacb64dac9174db64982e4742",
      "statement": "Claims preflight resolves each evidence resource at its stored version and classifies a claim as unresolved when any resource cannot be resolved, or stale when a resolved resource's current version differs from the stored version, with unresolved taking precedence over stale for a claim; resolution errors propagate rather than being treated as deleted evidence.",
